<![CDATA[<div style=""><div>Dear <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[client]</span>&nbsp;<br><br></div><div>Insperity's Safety Services team provides extensive safety consultation services to help you minimize workers compensation expenses and provide a safe working environment for your employees.<br><br></div><div>Your safety service team can provide comprehensive safety services at no additional cost to you. Our field Safety Consultants are professionals with qualified experience in safety and risk management; they offer practical solutions to your safety and risk management problems.</div><div><br>Below you will find a few of the available resources within our Safety Services team. You may also review the attached brochure to learn more about these services.<br><br></div><div><b>Safety Evaluation</b></div><div><ul><li>Hazard Identification</li><li>Safety Program Audit</li></ul></div><div><b>Safety Program Implementation</b></div><div><ul><li>Basic Safety Program</li><li>Hazard Control Programs</li><li>Safety Training</li></ul></div><div><b>Get started&nbsp;</b><br><br></div><div>Please feel welcome to reach out to me directly if you are interested in contacting your safety consultant.</div></div>]]></td>
